---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects"
  ><section class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Projects</p><h1>Things worth<br />building carefully.</h1><p class="lede">
      Selected work is shared at the level that is public, useful, and safe to discuss. Employer and
      customer systems are never represented here.
    </p>
  </section><section class="shell projects">
    <article class="project featured">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured · Planned</p><h2>12th Data</h2><p class="project-subtitle">
        Texas A&amp;M Football Data Platform
      </p><p>
        An open-source data platform concept combining data engineering, analytics, infrastructure,
        and visualization around public Texas A&amp;M football data.
      </p><div class="tags">
        Python · SQL · PostgreSQL · Parquet · Docker · Kubernetes · Terraform
      </div><p class="muted">
        Planned: public data pipelines, documented analysis, and transparent visualizations. No
        functionality is represented as implemented yet.
      </p>
    </article><article class="project">
      <p class="eyebrow">Future case study</p><h2>Platform reliability patterns</h2><p>
        Sanitized engineering notes on repeatable delivery, observability, and operational
        readiness.
      </p><span class="status">Planned</span>
    </article><article class="project">
      <p class="eyebrow">Future case study</p><h2>Operational data decisions</h2><p>
        Exploring how infrastructure signals and analytics can improve engineering prioritization.
      </p><span class="status">Planned</span>
    </article>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
